Doklo Studio demo workspace.

Every Dok, term, role and IA node under this directory is hand-written sample
data used to develop and demonstrate Studio. None of it was generated from
anyone's codebase, and none of it is a real analysis result.

Studio reads this file (.doklo/DEMO_WORKSPACE) and labels the whole UI as demo
data while it is loaded. Do not copy this file into a real workspace, and do
not delete it from this one.
